     4625                  o-KAssa     [p2]    @  F-KAssa
     4626                  o-Inv       [p2]    @  F-Inv
     4627                  o-spis      [p2]    @  F-spis
     4628                  o-sm        [p2]    @  F-sm
     4629                  with FRAME ZAPAS .
     4630      WHEN "B1":U  Then
     4631                DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12 sym13
     4632                   p3 @ gds-zap-b-code
     4633                   p4 @ gds-zap-artic
     4634                   p5 @ gds-zap-gds-name
     4635                   p6 @ gds-zap-unit-base
     4636                   p1 @ gds-type
