     4673                  bi-KAssa     [p2]    @  F-KAssa
     4674                  bi-Inv       [p2]    @  F-Inv
     4675                  bi-spis      [p2]    @  F-spis
     4676                  bi-sm        [p2]    @  F-sm
     4677                  with FRAME ZAPAS .
     4678      WHEN ""  Then DO:
