     4977      WHEN ""  Then     DO :
     4978                DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12 sym13
     4979                   p3 @ gds-zap-b-code
     4980                   p4 @ gds-zap-artic
     4981                   p5 @ gds-zap-gds-name
     4982                   p6 @ gds-zap-unit-base
     4983                   p1 @ gds-type
     4984                  vzvr      [p2]    @  F-vzvr
     4985                  vzvr-post [p2]    @  F-vzvr-post
     4986                  Prih      [p2]    @  F-Prih
     4987                  RAsh      [p2]    @  F-RAsh
     4988                  KAssa     [p2]    @  F-KAssa
     4989                  Inv       [p2]    @  F-Inv
     4990                  spis      [p2]    @  F-spis
     4991                  sm        [p2]    @  F-sm
     4992                  with FRAME ZAPAS .
     4993       if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted p3 CHR(9)
     4994                   p4 CHR(9)
     4995                   p5 CHR(9)
     4996                   p6 CHR(9)
     4997                   gds-zap-type CHR(9)
     4998                   Prih[1]  CHR(9)
